      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Darlinghurst"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The Eternity Playhouse on Burton Street opened in 2013 after renovating the former Burton Street Tabernacle founded in 1887.",
