      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Darlinghurst"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Darlinghurst is bounded by William Street to the north, Hyde Park to the west, Oxford Street to the south and Boundary Street to the east.",
